{
  "caveats": [
    "Livestock stocks and annual product output measure different things. Species groups cannot be added to product quantities, and goats and sheep cannot be separated from this table. National figures do not show district distribution, herd productivity, farm structure or food access. The published scaling is retained rather than converting thousands or millions to unlabelled counts.",
    "The source uses .. for unavailable figures and a dash for nil or negligible. Both retain their printed token and a distinct status; neither is converted to an exact zero."
  ],
